flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Generate Random Player Info]
    B --> C[Load Lobby Scene]
    C --> D[Subscribe Lobby Updates]

    D --> E{Host Starts Game?}
    E -- Yes --> F[StartGame]
    F --> G[Register OnLoadComplete]
    G --> H[Load GameScene for all clients]

    H --> I[Client finishes loading GameScene]
    I --> J[HandleLoadComplete]

    J -->|Host| K[SpawnPlayerRpc-clientId]
    K --> L[Spawn NetworkObject]
    L --> M[Assign PlayerNameDisplay]

    J -->|Host| N[HandlePlayerJoinNetworkClientRpc]

    N -->|Client| O[Send Name + AuthId]
    O --> P[HandlePlayerJoinNetworkServerRpc]
    P --> Q[Map NetId ↔ AuthId]
    Q --> R[Update Name Display]

    R --> S[Set GameState = InGame]
    S --> T[Show Notification UI]

    D --> U[OnUpdatedCurrentLobby]
    U --> V[Sync Lobby Player Names]
    V --> W[HandleUpdatePlayerDataServerRpc]

    X[Leave / Kick / Return Lobby] --> Y[Load Lobby Scene]
    Y --> Z[Clear Spawned Players]
    Z --> AA[Hide InGame UI]
    AA --> AB[GameState = MainMenu]
